  "prefLabel": "We 604.04 Removal of Pumping Equipment and Debris",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 604.04 Removal of Pumping Equipment and Debris. All pumping equipment, piping and wire, and any debris observed in the well, shall be removed from the well prior to sealing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 600) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
